# The framework's site's settings that aren't secret (F124): copy to .env (git-ignored) to set any of them. The compose
# file sets what the site always needs (the guide's door, its lead mail, the logs); the image carries the docs and the
# price tables. Everything here is optional.
#
# What the log lines show of the values they were given: hashed (the default) or full. Use full only on this PC.
# LOG_CONTENT=hashed
# Costs shown in the PC's currency (F14): the container can't see Windows' region, so write it here once.
# HOST_CULTURE=en-ZA
# How many guide sessions a visitor's address may open a day.
# OPEN_SESSIONS_PER_DAY=50
